@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About CDL Pool</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0">
                <div class="card-body p-5">
                    <div class="text-center mb-4">
                        <img src="/images/logo-light.png" alt="CDL Pool Logo" style="width: 300px; height: auto; object-fit: contain;" class="mb-3" />
                        <h1 class="fw-bold">About CDL Pool</h1>
                        <p class="text-muted lead">The New Generation CDL Platform</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <hr class="mb-4" />
                    
                    <div class="text-secondary" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                        <p>
                            <strong>CDL Pool</strong> is a revolutionary platform designed to bridge the gap between commercial drivers and top-tier logistics companies. 
                            Our mission is to simplify the hiring and application process by providing a unified, seamless, and intelligent matching system.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            With CDL Pool, drivers can effortlessly maintain their digital profiles, manage certifications, and apply to multiple jobs with a single click. 
                            Meanwhile, companies gain access to a curated pool of verified, highly-qualified drivers, utilizing our advanced skill-matching algorithms to find the perfect fit for their fleets.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We believe in empowering the trucking industry through technology, transparency, and trust. Welcome to the new generation of CDL career management.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
